# Example login.txt file for Meijer CLI
# Place this file at ~/.config/meijer/login.txt
# 
# Format: One username per line, optionally followed by password
# 
# Option 1: Username only (will prompt for password)
meijer.com@example.com
#
# Option 2: Username and password (no prompts needed)
# meijer.com@example.com
# your_password_here
#
# Note: If you only want to store username, comment out or remove the password line
# This is useful for security-conscious users who don't want passwords in plain text
